  --sans: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
  --mono: ui-monospace, "Cascadia Mono", "SF Mono", SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
}
```

### Regra Estrita da Scrollbar (4px)

```css
